<p>Releases poisonous spores at an area of radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 2, 2, 2,</acronym> infecting the foes inside with a random poison doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">242, 326, 391, 446, 495</acronym> Nature damage over 10 turns.</p><p>This attack can crit and deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">22%, 30%, 36%, 41%, 46%</acronym> additional critical damage.</p><p>The damage and critical bonus increase with your Mindpower.</p>